    "detailed_description": "<strong>Seedless Light is a 2d action-adventure game focused on combat and exploration with a unique and contemplative world of fantastic and vibrant creatures driven by a touching and atmospheric soundtrack. Unlock new skills by summoning powerful weapons to enable different combat styles. Absorb the ethereal seeds and learn from them their origin and purpose in this world.<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore a fantastic and unique world and discover the forgotten stories of its inhabitants<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411780/extras/50655b111996d221d86e4d1d2d20b63a.poster.avif?t=1695780482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411780/extras/50655b111996d221d86e4d1d2d20b63a.webm?t=1695780482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411780/extras/50655b111996d221d86e4d1d2d20b63a.mp4?t=1695780482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li>Summon weapons with different powers and abilities, such as speed, strength, range, attacks and special moves.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411780/extras/fd135eba29fd56d280b857988ac36adb.poster.avif?t=1695780482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411780/extras/fd135eba29fd56d280b857988ac36adb.webm?t=1695780482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411780/extras/fd135eba29fd56d280b857988ac36adb.mp4?t=1695780482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li>Unlock powerful seeds that will help you overcome challenges along your journey.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411780/extras/7a864c7eb7fb77a43dc6d5e0c23c627b.poster.avif?t=1695780482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411780/extras/7a864c7eb7fb77a43dc6d5e0c23c627b.webm?t=1695780482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411780/extras/7a864c7eb7fb77a43dc6d5e0c23c627b.mp4?t=1695780482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li>Test your dexterity and resilience against several foes ready to smash your fragile receptacle.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411780/extras/567468f76a43d14d5e1873ffe55d4020.poster.avif?t=1695780482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411780/extras/567468f76a43d14d5e1873ffe55d4020.webm?t=1695780482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411780/extras/567468f76a43d14d5e1873ffe55d4020.mp4?t=1695780482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li>All art, from music to animations and scenarios created with great care to bring a unique and atmospheric experience</li></ul></strong>",
