lass=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411780/extras/7a864c7eb7fb77a43dc6d5e0c23c627b.poster.avif?t=1695780482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411780/extras/7a864c7eb7fb77a43dc6d5e0c23c627b.webm?t=1695780482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411780/extras/7a864c7eb7fb77a43dc6d5e0c23c627b.mp4?t=1695780482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li>Test your dexterity and resilience against several foes ready to smash your fragile receptacle.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411780/extras/567468f76a43d14d5e1873ffe55d4020.poster.avif?t=1695780482\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411780/extras/567468f76a43d14d5e1873ffe55d4020.webm?t=1695780482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411780/extras/567468f76a43d14d5e1873ffe55d4020.mp4?t=1695780482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li>All art, from music to animations and scenarios created with great care to bring a unique and atmospheric experience</li></ul></strong>",
